libjnivm
Copyright (c) 2019 ChristopherHX
Licensed under the MIT License.
https://github.com/ChristopherHX/libjnivm

third_party/libjnivm/ stands in for Android's ART: it answers the JNI calls
libroblox.so makes into what it believes is a Java VM. Statically linked
(cargo:rustc-link-lib=static=jnivm). The MIT text is at
third_party/libjnivm/LICENSE.
